      "claim": "The rider's statement that they 'never got any message that he arrived' cannot fill the gap the impaired chat log leaves. It is contradicted by the trip record, which logs a push notification to the rider at 11:11:54 and records the rider's own 11:06:00 in-app entry stating they were at the Blk 19 lobby and would come out when the driver reached. A party's assertion is not evidence of the missing message fact, and the rider's account of the contact is at least partly inconsistent with the contemporaneous telemetry; it is not a substitute for the message leg POL-NS-23 requires.",
